          "type": "string",
          "description": "调用失败时的错误码,具体请参见[错误码](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-ocr/ocr_03_0028.html)。当出现错误码“ModelArts.4204”时,请参考[为什么调用API时提示“ModelArts.4204”?](https://support.huaweicloud.com/ocr_faq/ocr_01_0031.html)章节。\n调用成功时无此字段。"
